# Julia
*.jl.cov
*.jl.*.cov
*.jl.mem
/docs/Manifest.toml
/examples/Manifest.toml
# `/Manifest.toml` and `/test/Manifest.toml` are deliberately missing from this list.
# The regression references are compared inside the test environment, and Pkg builds that
# sandbox from *both* manifests: the root one fixes the versions of the package's own
# dependencies. Pinning only the test manifest makes CI resolve the root one afresh and
# then reconcile the two, which is unsatisfiable. They are committed as a pair, and CI
# instantiates them as-is. See `test/regression/README.md`.
/deps/deps.jl
LocalPreferences.toml

